%% title: TPP Registration & Verification Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant EBA as EBA Register
    participant SyncJob as EBA Sync Job
    participant TPPReg as TPP Registry Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Outbox as TPP Outbox
    participant Kafka
    participant PSD2 as PSD2 Service

    SyncJob->>EBA: fetch national competent authority list
    EBA-->>SyncJob: TPP entries (AISP/PISP/CBPII)
    SyncJob->>DB: UPSERT tpp_entries (tpp_id, name, roles, qwac_expires_at)
    SyncJob->>DB: UPDATE eba_sync_state (last_success_at, total_entries)
    SyncJob->>Outbox: INSERT tpp_outbox (TPP_REGISTRY_SYNCED)
    Outbox->>Kafka: publish TPP_REGISTRY_SYNCED

    PSD2->>TPPReg: GET /api/v1/tpp/{tpp_id} (verify on API call)
    TPPReg->>DB: SELECT tpp_entries WHERE tpp_id AND status=ACTIVE
    DB-->>TPPReg: TPP record with roles & certificate DNs
    TPPReg-->>PSD2: 200 OK (roles, qwac_subject_dn, valid)

    note over TPPReg,DB: Blacklisting
    TPPReg->>DB: UPDATE tpp_entries SET status=BLACKLISTED, blacklisted_at
    TPPReg->>Outbox: INSERT tpp_outbox (TPP_BLACKLISTED)
    Outbox->>Kafka: publish TPP_BLACKLISTED
